  "UpdateAkitaDAOPlugin": {
    "artifact": "arc58/plugins/update-akita-dao/UpdateAkitaDAOPlugin.arc56.json",
    "registryKey": "updatePlugin",
    "plugin": true,
    "daoField": null,
    "defaults": {
      "clearProgram": [
        11,
        129,
        1,
        67
      ]
    },
    "notes": [
      "Principal resolution (docs/principal-resolution/PHASE-0-SPEC.md §7.1) Phase 2a: the page-growing Update plugin. Install it with scripts/principal-phase2a-update-plugin.ts, which repoints pal.update and swaps the DAO wallet grant in one proposal.",
      "clearProgram (constructor) is the clear program pushed when a call does not stage one: AVM 11 'pushint 1; return' (0b810143). Phase 2 stages each artifact's own clear program.",
      "Execution-key upgrades are bound to their UpgradeApp action and target: by default through DAO.isUpgradeLease (tree DAO); with the SDK daoBinding option (note akita:upgrade-binding:proposal) through DAO.mustGetExecution + DAO.getProposal, which the deployed MainNet DAO has. scripts/principal-phase2-upgrade-targets.ts picks the read from the live DAO; the DAO itself is upgraded with --target AkitaDAO."
    ]
  },
